//
// Authority: `.design/forge/degrade-ladder.md` OQ-2 — the under-bound
// discriminator is kani's boilerplate `unwinding assertion loop N`; a concrete
// `Failed Checks: assertion failed: <ens clause>` is a COUNTEREXAMPLE. The
